  "description": "Sangyi, an intern at the biggest entertainment company, struggles every day from his boss who's busy stealing his credit, and his jealous teammates. One day, he stumbles upon Insoo performing on the street and is immediately mesmerized by his voice. Sangyi finds Insoo's voice oddly familiar, but he can't seem to remember their bizarre first encounter. Will Sangyi ever find out where he met Insoo for the first time?\n\n(Source: POCKET COMICS) \n\n*Note: Chapter count includes a prologue.*",
